iti pañcadaśamālā ||  || 

mālāmaṃtro mahādevyāḥ sarvasiddhipradāyaka | 
ekatriṃśatsahasrārṇā trilokīmohanakṣamaḥ || 

eṣāṃ vidyāṃ mahāsiddhi yonīsmṛtimātrataḥ 
agnivātamahākṣobhe rājarāṣṭre syecitmaye || 

luṇṭhake taskarabhaye saṃgrāme salilaplave | 
samudrayāna vikṣepe bhūtpretādije bhaye || 

ḍākinīpūtanā caiva yakṣakumbhāṇḍaje bhaye | 
apasmārajvalaṃ vyādhi mṛtyunmādāyije bhaye || 

mitrabhede grahabhaye vyasane cātri cārake | 
anveṣvapiṣadoṣeṣu mālomattaṃ smared budhaḥ || 

sarvopadravanirmuktaḥ sākṣāchivasamābhavet | 
āpatkāle nityapūjā vistarāt kartumakṣamaḥ || 

ekāvarttanasātreṇa sarve pūjā phalaṃ bhavet | 
navāvaraṇadevīnāṃ lalitāyā mahojasaḥ ||

ekatragaṇanārūpo vedavedāṃta gocaraḥ |
sarvāgamarahasyārtha smaraṇāt pāpanāśinī || 

lalitāyā maheśānyā mālāvidyā mahīyasi |
naravaṇya narendrāśā vaṇyamrāri vaśaṅkaraṃ ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ rañjanaṃ yāya bhañjana |
tattadhāvaraṇāsyāyī devatāchandamantrajaṃ ||

mālāmaṃtramimaṃguhyaṃ paraṃdhāma prakīrtyate |

<68b>

iti mālāmaṃtraphalastuti samāptaḥ || || 

oṃ śrīmahācaṇḍikāyai || śrīgurumūrttirjayati || 

īśanme vyavatāṃ nṛṇāṃ jaḍadhiyo dharmādi sarvārthadaṃ 
cinmātraspharaṇaprabādhajanakaṃ viśvādi kṛnmūchayāṃ || 
ādhārāṅkata vīthikāttajaladhau śāntaṃ varābhītidaṃ 
śrīnārāyaṇavīraśaṅkaraguroḥ pādāmbuja te bhaje || 1 ||

athoddharāmitāṃ vidyāṃ traipurā vṛttimālikāṃ |
śaśibhūṣaṇatantroktāṃ vivekānanda yogirāt || 2 || 

tatra śaśibhūṣaṇa tatra || 2 || 

śrīpārvatyuvāca || 

devadevamahādeva devadānavavandite | 
mahāpuṣpāñjali bruhi vaddhanāmāvalī manu || 3 || 

śrīmahābhairava uvāca || 

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi nāmarūpāvaliṃ priya | 
vaddhā śrītraipurī mudrāṃ supuṣpāñjali garbhitām || 4 || 

pathitvā vaidikāṃ maṇtrāmatharvaṇasamudbhavā | 
mālāmantra paded devi lalitāyā parātpara || 5 || 

mantroddhāra pravakṣyāmi nāmarūpā vali priye |
uddharen mandinānāṃ vairnāmāni kramaśaḥ sudhīḥ || 6 || 

kalāmūrttestataḥ paścāccaturnnavatisaṃkṣayā | 
ātmapūjā parāpūjā krameṇāpi tataḥ paraṃ || 7 || 

tatastu pīṭha devānāṃ dhyānādyāsanaṣoḍaśān | 
tata śrītripurā devyā mayukhānāṃ tathoddharet || 8 || 

sarvāvaraṇadevīnāṃ vāhyābhyantarabhedataḥ | 
śūnyacakrastha devānāmūrddhānnāye kramān sudhīḥ || 9 || 

mahāśūnyākhya cakre tu śāmbhavaṃ kramamuddharet |
itirityāmaheśāni mālāṃvidyā garīyasi || 10 ||

